  "description": "## What's New in v4.6.0\n\n### Conversation Summary Policy\n- `SummaryConversationPolicy` — Automatically summarize old messages when conversation exceeds token or message count thresholds\n- Factory methods: `ByToken()`, `ByMessage()`, `ByBoth()` for flexible configuration\n- Summary injected as system message prefix via `GetEffectiveSystemMessage()`\n- StatelessMode protection for summary LLM calls\n- Incremental summarization with existing summary context\n- Session persistence via `CurrentSummary` / `LoadSummary()`\n- Provider-agnostic: works with all supported providers\n\n### Real-Time Streaming Fix\n- **Fixed**: `StreamAsync()` was collecting all chunks before yielding — now yields each chunk immediately as it arrives from the API\n- **Affected providers**: Claude (Anthropic), ChatGPT (OpenAI), Grok (xAI)\n- **Not affected**: DeepSeek, Gemini, Sonar (already streaming correctly)\n- **New regression test**: `StreamingIsRealTimeNotBatchedTest` — verifies chunk timing spread > 200ms\n\n### Internal Improvements\n- `HashSet<ChatBlock>` → `List<ChatBlock>` — Simpler and more predictable (no Equals/GetHashCode override on ChatBlock)\n- Default `ChatBlock` initialization in base constructor — `ActivateChat` is never null, eliminates NRE risk\n- Removed redundant `AddNewChat()` calls from all 6 concrete service constructors\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro, GPT-5.2 Codex\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### xAI Grok\n- Grok 4, Grok 4.1 Fast\n- Grok 3, Grok 3 Mini\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI",
